       --ww, ----wwhhiitteelliisstt--eennvviirroonnmmeenntt=_l_i_s_t
           Don’t reset the environment variables specified in the
           comma-separated _l_i_s_t when clearing the environment for ----llooggiinn. The
           whitelist is ignored for the environment variables HHOOMMEE, SSHHEELLLL,
           UUSSEERR, LLOOGGNNAAMMEE, and PPAATTHH.

