SSIIGGNNAALLSS
       Upon receiving either SSIIGGIINNTT, SSIIGGQQUUIITT or SSIIGGTTEERRMM, ssuu terminates its
       child and afterwards terminates itself with the received signal. The
       child is terminated by SSIIGGTTEERRMM, after unsuccessful attempt and 2
       seconds of delay the child is killed by SSIIGGKKIILLLL.

